{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261027/photo/bkn-20261027093024399-1027_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261027094356\"/><p>赤柱正灘泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（27日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘、石澳泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該4處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該4處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T02:00:38.600156+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T01:30:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T02:38:35.066127+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T01:58:26.967559+00:00","content_hash":"8030ba063463ddb20f13eaf2006c283bcf5b1f6363fdb4fb9e9e3e79ebb71706","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}